## Waveshare 2-Channel CAN HAT configuration

This section is for the Waveshare 2-channel MCP2515 CAN HAT used in this setup.

Important: Waveshare sells different 2-channel CAN boards. Do not blindly copy these lines unless your HAT model matches this setup.

If your Waveshare board is not the same MCP2515-based 2-channel HAT, verify the overlay lines against your exact Waveshare model before continuing.

First install the practical CAN tools:

```bash
sudo apt update
```

```bash
sudo apt install -y can-utils python3-can
```

These packages are enough for the basic CAN checks used in this guide, including:

```text
candump
cansend
python3 ~/klipper/scripts/canbus_query.py
```

You do not need extra random Python or pip installs if `canbus_query.py` already runs.

